            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                
                <p n="1-3">Tirthy-seventh year of the victorious king Nanti<corr>cc</corr>uraparumaṉ.<note>Sanskrit Nandīśvaravarman.</note></p>
                
                
                <p n="3-5">
                    Vakkaṭi, son <supplied reason="subaudible">of</supplied> Mārikappākiḻar<note>Mārikappāvakiḻār in <bibl>
                        <ptr target="bib:Avanam"/></bibl> introduction to the inscription.</note> <supplied reason="subaudible">in/of</supplied> the <foreign>nāṭu</foreign> of Vikramāditya, lord of Vaḷḷipēṭunātu, fell.
                </p>
                
            </div>
            
